<?xml version='1.0' encoding='UTF-8'?>
<workout_file>
  <author>Gravel God Training</author>
  <name>Tempo w/ cadence changes</name>
  <description>FUEL:
Normal meal ~2h before. One bottle, 40-50g carbs. Done.

WARM-UP:
• 10min easy spin, building 55-65% FTP.

MAIN SET:
• 3 sets of 3x [2min @85-89% FTP (low cadence) + 1min @85-89% FTP (high cadence)], with 5min easy spin @50-60% FTP between sets.
• Focus on smooth transitions between cadences - same power target, different leg speed. Note where your pedal stroke changes or breaks down.

COOL-DOWN:
• 10min easy @40-50% FTP.

EXECUTION:
• These efforts build your aerobic engine and your ability to produce power comfortably across a wide cadence range - a key skill as gradient, wind, and group pace force cadence changes.

RPE guide: 87% FTP -> RPE 5-6; 55% FTP -> RPE 3</description>
  <sportType>bike</sportType>
  <workout>
    <Warmup Duration="600" PowerLow="0.55" PowerHigh="0.65"/>
    <IntervalsT Repeat="3" OnDuration="120" OnPower="0.87" CadenceLow="55" CadenceHigh="65" OffDuration="60" OffPower="0.87"/>
    <SteadyState Duration="300" Power="0.55"/>
    <IntervalsT Repeat="3" OnDuration="120" OnPower="0.87" CadenceLow="55" CadenceHigh="65" OffDuration="60" OffPower="0.87"/>
    <SteadyState Duration="300" Power="0.55"/>
    <IntervalsT Repeat="3" OnDuration="120" OnPower="0.87" CadenceLow="55" CadenceHigh="65" OffDuration="60" OffPower="0.87"/>
    <SteadyState Duration="300" Power="0.55"/>
    <Cooldown Duration="600" PowerLow="0.50" PowerHigh="0.40"/>
  </workout>
</workout_file>